// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Preset Options -- alter the preset you have selected.
//
// A preset is a hue range plus swings in saturation and brightness. Each lane
// takes a different quarter of that range and walks eight shades through it,
// so moving one slider here moves all 32 colours together and they stay
// related rather than drifting apart.
//
// Edits apply immediately but are not kept: switching preset reloads it.
// Save to keep them over that preset, restore to throw them away.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

